flowchart TD
    Source[External Source] --> Discovery[Discovery Service]
    Discovery --> Norm[URL Normalization]
    Norm --> Queue[Redis URL Queue]
    Queue --> Crawl[Crawl4AI Workers]
    Crawl --> RawStorage[(S3 Raw Storage)]
    Crawl --> HTML[Raw HTML / Markdown]
    HTML --> MainContent[Main-content Extraction]
    MainContent --> Boilerplate[Boilerplate Removal]
    Boilerplate --> MD[Clean Markdown]
    MD --> Meta[Metadata Extraction]
    Meta --> Lang[Language Detection]
    Lang --> DocType[Document Type Classification]
    DocType --> TopicClass[Topic / Company / Role Classification]
    TopicClass --> Quality[Quality & Relevance Assessment]
    Quality --> Dedupe[Deduplication Service]
    Dedupe --> Chunking[Chunking Service]
    Chunking --> Embed[Embedding Service]
    Embed --> Mongo[(MongoDB Vector Search)]
